WEBVTT

NOTE
Confrontation on the parade float. Edea descends her throne. Seifer stands as her knight. Edea stares coldly toward the camera — the moment before she strikes.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Through the gate, the camera moves onto the float amid ornate columns and firelight.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Edea descends from her golden throne. Her dark dress trails past the braziers.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Seifer grins, his scarred face lit by flame. He stands guard before the Sorceress.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Edea stares forward, cold and imperious. Her headdress fans wide, face paint gleaming.
